1
00:00:06,319 --> 00:00:09,819
(Sheldon:)Stuart, I was wondering
if you could help me find something.

2
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,700
(Stuart:)Happy to, unless it's hope
or a reason to live.

3
00:00:13,994 --> 00:00:16,944
(Sheldon:)Oh, you make me laugh, sad clown.

4
00:00:18,865 --> 00:00:22,035
(Sheldon:)Anyhoo, Leonard will be back
in a couple days

5
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:24,372
and I need a welcome-home
gift for him.

6
00:00:24,537 --> 00:00:26,947
(Sheldon:)As he's been at sea,
perhaps something

7
00:00:27,107 --> 00:00:29,487
(Sheldon:)with a nautical theme
might be appropriate.

8
00:00:29,643 --> 00:00:32,353
(Stuart:)Okay, well, I don't know
how much you want to spend,

9
00:00:32,512 --> 00:00:35,552
(Stuart:)but I do have this pretty
cool Aquaman statue.

10
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:43,829
(Sheldon:)Aquaman?
This isn't a gag gift, Stuart.

11
00:00:45,225 --> 00:00:47,895
(Stuart:)Yeah, just as well.
It's a pretty rare piece.

12
00:00:48,061 --> 00:00:50,131
(Stuart:)I'd rather just sell it
to a real collector.

13
00:00:50,296 --> 00:00:53,406
I'm areal collector.

14
00:00:53,566 --> 00:00:55,736
(Sheldon:)How rare is it?

15
00:00:55,902 --> 00:00:58,512
(Stuart:)I shouldn't even have mentioned it.
How about a Batman squirt gun?

16
00:00:58,705 --> 00:00:59,805
(Penny:)Ye--

17
00:01:00,006 --> 00:01:03,646
(Sheldon:)Don't try and trick me
into buying something I don't want.

